WEBVTT

00:52:57.755 --> 00:53:03.603
AI is already beating people
in specific types of disease diagnosis.

00:53:03.627 --> 00:53:05.069
And over time,

00:53:05.093 --> 00:53:08.014
that AI diagnosis
will get better and better

00:53:08.038 --> 00:53:14.713
so that the human doctor
is going to not need to memorize

00:53:14.737 --> 00:53:18.097
all the new drugs and treatments
and personalized treatments --

00:53:18.121 --> 00:53:19.581
AI can do that.

00:53:19.605 --> 00:53:23.382
A human doctor can connect to the patient,

00:53:23.406 --> 00:53:26.152
listen to his or her troubles,

00:53:26.176 --> 00:53:30.180
basically tease out all the symptoms
and family history